  "title": "Fresh whipped cream with blackberries",
  "description": "The proportion for this recipe is for the mini glasses. If you are using regular wine glasses you'll get 2-3 servings.",
  "editorial": {
    "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Treat yourself with this mini dessert that is perfect for any occasion. It takes minimum time to make and looks fabulous. Fruits can be fresh or frozen, don't worry : it will taste the same. This fresh whipped cream with blackberries will be perfect with <a href=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/cafe-gourmand\">a cafe gourmand</a>!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe {\"id\":21647,\"template\":\"chic-template-english\",\"updated\":1656968293522} -->\n<!--WPRM Recipe 21647-->\n<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe\">\n\t<h2 class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-name\">Fresh whipped cream with blackberries</h2>\n\t<img class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-image\" src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/IMG_2433-2.Blog_-150x150.png\"/>\t<p class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-summary\">\n\t\tThe proportion for this recipe is for the mini glasses.  If you are using regular wine glasses you'll get 2-3 servings.\t</p>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-equipment\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-ingredients\">\n\t\t<ul><li>1 cup blackberries</li><li>1 cup heavy whipping cream (very cold)</li><li>2  tsp granulated sugar</li><li>1/4 tsp cocoa powder</li></ul>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-instructions\">\n\t\t<ol><li>Whip heavy cream fluffy, until soft peaks form, but not too firm.<br /><img src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/IMG_2430.Blog_-1-150x150.png\"/><br /></li><li>Equally divide washed fruits into prepared glasses. Using the piping bag or small spoon, equally spread the cream into the glasses. Refrigerate if not serving it immediately.<br /><img src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/IMG_2431.Blog_-2-150x150.png\"/><br /></li><li>Before serving, dust it with cacao powder.<br /><img src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/IMG_2433-3.Blog_-2-150x150.png\"/><br /></li></ol>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-notes\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta-course\">Cafe gourmand, Dessert</div>\t</div>\n</div>\n<!--End WPRM Recipe-->\n<!-- /wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe -->",
    "excerpt": null
  },
